	| Grace Period End Date | ${staticFullEndDate}                                  |
	| Current Provisioned   | 0                                                     |
	| Current Purchased     | 1                                                     |
	| State                 | ACTIVE                                                |
	And the "Active" product tab should have the count value "2"
