	And I should be able to view the product with the name "Platinum Subscription" and the following values on the account details page
	| Name                | Platinum Subscription |
	| Current Provisioned | 0                     |
	| Current Purchased   | 1                     |
	| State               | ACTIVE                |
	And I should not be able to view the product with the name "Portal Production" on the account details page
	And I should not be able to view the product with the name "Gold Subscription" on the account details page
	And the "Active" product tab should have the count value "2"
	And the "Future" product tab should have the count value "1"
	And the "Complimentary" product tab should have the count value "0"
	And the "Future" product tab should have the count value "1"
	And the "Cancelled" product tab should have the count value "0"
	And the "All" product tab should have the count value "4"
